From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shiny <owner@shinychang.net>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 00:27:04 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat: reopen the last session on launch by default

Shiny is used like an editor, which reopens its files; a profile can still
pick another startup option in settings.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01BYkQJUafT3hpFT1kBmDgzX
---
 chrome/browser/prefs/session_startup_pref.cc | 3 ++-
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/chrome/browser/prefs/session_startup_pref.cc b/chrome/browser/prefs/session_startup_pref.cc
index 72fc94f516..2cdfe439b5 100644
--- a/chrome/browser/prefs/session_startup_pref.cc
+++ b/chrome/browser/prefs/session_startup_pref.cc
@@ -82,7 +82,8 @@ SessionStartupPref::Type SessionStartupPref::GetDefaultStartupType() {
     return SessionStartupPref::LAST;
   }
 #endif
-  return SessionStartupPref::DEFAULT;
+  // Shiny reopens the last session on launch, like an editor reopens its files.
+  return SessionStartupPref::LAST;
 #endif
 }
 
